,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"2891516809","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":1908,"tweets":6002},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/nXofBu7sEB"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2114643197834010672"],"editable_until_msecs":"1793008801000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":true},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_annotations":{"is_image_editable_by_grok":false},"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"is_available":false},"is_translatable":false,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":23,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"2114643197834010672","created_at":"Mon Oct 26 09:00:01 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,157],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"interpol.int/News-and-Event…","expanded_url":"https://www.interpol.int/News-and-Events/News/2026/INTERPOL-launches-public-awareness-campaign-highlighting-risk-of-AI-deepfake-scams","indices":[134,157],"url":"https://t.co/ORFAkNSCs8"}]},"favorite_count":165,"favorited":false,"full_text":"国際刑事警察機構（INTERPOL）は、ディープフェイクを用いた犯罪の危険性について啓発活動を行っており、3本の動画を公開しています。これらの動画ではディープフェイクが詐欺などの犯罪に利用される危険性に警鐘を鳴らしています。\n以下のリンクから動画をご覧いただけます。\nhttps://t.co/ORFAkNSCs8","id_str":"2114643197834010672","is_quote_status":true,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":7,"quoted_status_id_str":"2112086808980865468","quoted_status_permalink":{"display":"x.com/INTERPOL_HQ/st…","expanded":"https://twitter.com/INTERPOL_HQ/status/2112086808980865468","url":"https://t.co/Xo825XKmuk"},"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":71,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"2891516809"},"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","content_disclosure":{"ai_generated_disclosure":{"ai_generated_detection_source":"UserDeclared","can_edit":true,"has_ai_generated_media":true}},"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":13013},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1898144614483202048/Gff6iUYC_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/50643002/1773258566"},"core":{"created_at":"Thu Jun 25 13:21:34 +0000 2009","name":"INTERPOL","screen_name":"INTERPOL_HQ"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":true},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjo1MDY0MzAwMg==","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"International"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"Uniting 196 countries to fight today’s most pressing crime threats.\nReport crimes to your local police.\nFollow our Secretary General @INTERPOL_SG","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"interpol.int","expanded_url":"http://www.interpol.int","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/Mdtq0MDZJ2"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"en","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":347028,"following":614},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"50643002","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":4691,"tweets":13036},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/Mdtq0MDZJ2"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2112086808980865468"],"editable_until_msecs":"1792399310000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"data":{"associated_data":{},"destination_language":"ja","entities":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[616,632],"text":"DontTakeTheBait"}],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"interpol.int/en/News-and-Ev…","expanded_url":"https://www.interpol.int/en/News-and-Events/News/2026/INTERPOL-launches-public-awareness-campaign-highlighting-risk-of-AI-deepfake-scams","indices":[646,669],"url":"https://t.co/Jjid1gXbyZ"}],"user_mentions":[]},"preview_translation":"こんなことを想像してみてください。上司から電話がかかってきて、助けを求めてきます。急ぎの用件です。間違いなく彼です：あなたは彼をはっきりと見え、聞こえます。\n\nでも、もしそうでなかったら？","source_language":"en","translation":"こんなことを想像してみてください。上司から電話がかかってきて、助けを求めてきます。急ぎの用件です。間違いなく彼です：あなたは彼をはっきりと見え、聞こえます。\n\nでも、もしそうでなかったら？ ディープフェイク技術は急速に進化しています。AIは今や、オンラインで見つけた数枚の写真、ビデオ、またはオーディオクリップだけで、本物の顔、声、行動を再現できます。\n\nこの脅威は職場を超えて広がります；詐欺師たちは友人や家族を装い、感情を悪用し、偽の緊急感を作り出して、あなたに素早く行動させようとします。\n\nでは、どうすればいいでしょうか？\n\n🔵 急がないでください。信頼できる相手と話していると信じていても、状況を評価するために一瞬立ち止まってください。\n\n🔵 確認してください。電話を切って、相手の通常の番号にかけ直してください。\n\n🔵 セーフワードを使いましょう。親しい人々と秘密の合言葉を決めておいてください。\n\n🔵 アカウントを保護してください。すべての場所で二要素認証をオンにしてください。大規模なビジネス取引には多段階検証を有効にしてください。\n\n🔵 報告してください。詐欺が疑われる場合、すぐに地元警察に連絡してください。\n\n🔵 チームを訓練してください。事業主の方：スタッフがフィッシング、ビッシング、その他のソーシャルエンジニアリングの戦術を認識するよう訓練されていることを確認してください。\n\n待って。検証してください。#DontTakeTheBait\n\n詳細はこちら ➡️ 🔗 https://t.co/Jjid1gXbyZ\n\nFunded by 🇯🇵"},"is_available":true},"is_translatable":true,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":99,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"2112086808980865468","created_at":"Mon Oct 19 07:41:50 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,276],"entities":{"media":[{"additional_media_info":{"monetizable":false},"allow_download_status":{"allow_download":true},"display_url":"pic.x.com/YiDA5qLMgH","expanded_url":"https://x.com/INTERPOL_HQ/status/2112086808980865468/video/1","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"id_str":"2112083823202615296","indices":[277,300],"media_key":"13_2112083823202615296","media_results":{"result":{"media_key":"13_2112083823202615296"}},"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112083823202615296/img/QicuKIbY57R4fJyP.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[],"height":1920,"width":1080},"sizes":{"large":{"h":1920,"resize":"fit","w":1080},"medium":{"h":1200,"resize":"fit","w":675},"small":{"h":680,"resize":"fit","w":383},"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"video","url":"https://t.co/YiDA5qLMgH","video_info":{"aspect_ratio":[9,16],"duration_millis":46500,"variants":[{"content_type":"application/x-mpegURL","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/pl/WFAG-1frFpRaQ8YB.m3u8?tag=29&v=406"},{"bitrate":632000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/320x568/PKB6P3bOpxE4A9ty.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":950000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/480x852/mywVxUw5pptY7gm-.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":2176000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/720x1280/C2IQf4IpKZvfjCz4.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":10368000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/1080x1920/JsgI4Y4rjhsKkr2F.mp4?tag=29"}]}}]},"extended_entities":{"media":[{"additional_media_info":{"monetizable":false},"allow_download_status":{"allow_download":true},"display_url":"pic.x.com/YiDA5qLMgH","expanded_url":"https://x.com/INTERPOL_HQ/status/2112086808980865468/video/1","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"id_str":"2112083823202615296","indices":[277,300],"media_key":"13_2112083823202615296","media_results":{"result":{"media_key":"13_2112083823202615296"}},"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112083823202615296/img/QicuKIbY57R4fJyP.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[],"height":1920,"width":1080},"sizes":{"large":{"h":1920,"resize":"fit","w":1080},"medium":{"h":1200,"resize":"fit","w":675},"small":{"h":680,"resize":"fit","w":383},"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"video","url":"https://t.co/YiDA5qLMgH","video_info":{"aspect_ratio":[9,16],"duration_millis":46500,"variants":[{"content_type":"application/x-mpegURL","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/pl/WFAG-1frFpRaQ8YB.m3u8?tag=29&v=406"},{"bitrate":632000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/320x568/PKB6P3bOpxE4A9ty.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":950000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/480x852/mywVxUw5pptY7gm-.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":2176000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/720x1280/C2IQf4IpKZvfjCz4.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":10368000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112083823202615296/vid/avc1/1080x1920/JsgI4Y4rjhsKkr2F.mp4?tag=29"}]}}]},"favorite_count":367,"favorited":false,"full_text":"Imagine this. Your boss calls and asks for your help. It’s urgent. It’s definitely him: you can see and hear him clearly. \n\nBut what if it isn’t? Deepfake technology has evolved rapidly. AI can now replicate real faces, voices and behaviours using just a few photos, videos or https://t.co/YiDA5qLMgH","id_str":"2112086808980865468","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"en","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":32,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":208,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"50643002"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[1126,1142],"text":"DontTakeTheBait"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"interpol.int/en/News-and-Ev…","expanded_url":"https://www.interpol.int/en/News-and-Events/News/2026/INTERPOL-launches-public-awareness-campaign-highlighting-risk-of-AI-deepfake-scams","indices":[1164,1187],"url":"https://t.co/Jjid1gXbyZ"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMTIwODY4MDg2OTU1Nzg2MjQ=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"Imagine this. Your boss calls and asks for your help. It’s urgent. It’s definitely him: you can see and hear him clearly. \n\nBut what if it isn’t? Deepfake technology has evolved rapidly. AI can now replicate real faces, voices and behaviours using just a few photos, videos or audio clips found online.   \n\nThe threat extends beyond the workplace; scammers can impersonate friends and family, preying on emotion and creating a false sense of urgency to make you act quickly. \n\nSo what should you do? \n\n🔵 Don’t rush. Even if you believe you’re speaking to someone you trust, take a moment to assess the situation. \n\n🔵 Verify. Hang up and call the person back on their usual number. \n\n🔵 Use a safeword. Establish a secret phrase with close contacts. \n\n🔵 Secure your accounts. Turn on two-factor authentication everywhere. Activate multi-step verification for large business transactions. \n\n🔵 Report it. If you suspect a scam, contact local law enforcement immediately. \n\n🔵 Train your teams. Business owners: make sure your staff are trained to recognise phishing, vishing and other social engineering tactics. \n\nWait. Validate. #DontTakeTheBait \n\nFind out more ➡️ 🔗 https://t.co/Jjid1gXbyZ\n\nFunded by 🇯🇵"}}},"rest_id":"2112086808980865468","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"31098","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2114643197834010672","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"6983","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2114643197834010672","sortIndex":"2114706329535774697"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":144,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2110635766447534081/a6h2NotN?format=j